# Umber — KDE Plasma 6 color scheme
# Palette: 16 colors in 4 tiers (Hearth, Glow, Mist, Spark). Source of truth: palette-preview.svg in the repo root.
#   Hearth (surfaces):  #26221E #2D2823 #363029 #48413A
#   Glow (warm fgs):    #A89986 #D4BC91 #E1CDA5 #F0E5D0
#   Mist (cool accents): #4F7A7E #7AA8AC #88A6C5 #A8BDD6
#   Spark (vivid):       red #E06C75  orange #D19A66  amber #E5C07B  green #98C379  violet #C586B0
# Negative=spark.red, Neutral=spark.amber, Positive=spark.green, Visited=spark.violet (web-link convention).

